1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:03,862
Running a bakery, a flower
shop, or a meal-prep kitchen?

2
00:00:03,992 --> 00:00:05,450
Then you know the feeling.

3
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:09,867
Too many orders on one day, and
customers asking: when will mine arrive?

4
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:11,773
Meet Pickday.

5
00:00:11,903 --> 00:00:13,678
Let customers pick the day.

6
00:00:14,883 --> 00:00:19,084
Pickday adds a date picker to your
cart, cart drawer and product pages.

7
00:00:19,214 --> 00:00:24,662
Customers choose local delivery, store pickup
or shipping, then a day and a time slot.

8
00:00:24,792 --> 00:00:26,985
Only the days you're open can be picked.

9
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:32,013
Set how many orders you can handle
each day, or in each time slot.

10
00:00:32,143 --> 00:00:34,980
When a slot fills up, it closes by itself.

11
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:40,021
Add cut-off times, preparation time, and
different limits for your busiest days.

12
00:00:41,083 --> 00:00:44,976
At checkout, customers only see the
method they picked, with their date.

13
00:00:45,106 --> 00:00:50,375
And if the date is missing or no longer
available, the order stops before it reaches you.

14
00:00:51,417 --> 00:00:55,303
In your admin, see every order
by day, and how full each day is.

15
00:00:55,433 --> 00:00:58,017
Move orders to another
date in a few clicks.

16
00:00:58,147 --> 00:01:02,244
Customers can even change their
own date, up to a deadline you set.

17
00:01:03,283 --> 00:01:07,381
Start each day with a printed day
sheet, route sheet or production list.

18
00:01:07,511 --> 00:01:12,381
And get tomorrow's orders by email
every day, free, with Shopify Flow.

19
00:01:13,417 --> 00:01:16,288
Public holidays come back
every year on their own.

20
00:01:16,418 --> 00:01:19,348
Add closed days, or
switch on vacation mode.

21
00:01:19,478 --> 00:01:23,327
And the picker speaks your customers'
language, right-to-left included.

22
00:01:24,383 --> 00:01:28,654
Pickday works on every Shopify
plan, with no theme code to edit.

23
00:01:28,784 --> 00:01:31,409
A short setup wizard gets
you ready in minutes.

24
00:01:32,450 --> 00:01:33,314
Pickday.

25
00:01:33,444 --> 00:01:35,218
Let customers pick the day.

26
00:01:35,348 --> 00:01:37,505
Find it on the Shopify App Store.
